Package: beamhound
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), curl, tar
Section: APPLaunch
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bfeller/beamhound
Description: Identify any IR remote and turn the Cardputer Zero into it
 Point a remote at the Cardputer and press Power. Beamhound decodes the
 signal, matches it against the community Flipper-IRDB database and asks a
 few smart questions until it knows your device, then gives you a remote
 control screen for it. The database is downloaded on first run.
